|  {O}.-'~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~`-.
| {O}(~~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~{W}:::::
| {O}(~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~~{S}~{O}~{W}::::::
| {O}`({W}u u{O})-----({W}u u{O})
@layer 23 4 head

@pose peek
@layer 9 2 head
@layer 11 10
|{W}(u u)     (u u)

